---
title: p256verify_main (EIP-7951)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> q_decode : decode input (h, r, s, qx, qy)
    q_decode --> q_validate_len : check input_length == 160
    q_validate_len --> q_validate_sig : input_length == 160
    q_validate_len --> q_fail : input_length != 160
    q_validate_sig --> q_validate_pk : 0 < r < n AND 0 < s < n
    q_validate_sig --> q_fail : r or s out of range
    q_validate_pk --> q_validate_curve : 0 <= qx < p AND 0 <= qy < p
    q_validate_pk --> q_fail : qx or qy out of range
    q_validate_curve --> q_validate_inf : qy^2 == qx^3 + a*qx + b (mod p)
    q_validate_curve --> q_fail : point not on curve
    q_validate_inf --> q_verify : (qx, qy) != (0, 0)
    q_validate_inf --> q_fail : point is at infinity
    q_verify --> q_check_result : run signature verification
    q_check_result --> q_success : signature valid
    q_check_result --> q_fail : signature invalid
    q_success --> [*] : return 0x01 (32 bytes)
    q_fail --> [*] : return empty

    note right of q_validate_len
        INV-001: Precompile MUST NOT revert under any circumstances
        INV-002: Gas consumed is always 6900 regardless of success or failure
    end note

    note right of q_success
        INV-003: Output is exactly 32 bytes on success, 0 bytes on failure
        INV-004: Precompile address is 0x100
    end note
